# Soul Burn: "You gain life equal to the damage dealt, but not more than the amount of {B} spent on X" (CR 107.3, 601.2h).
# The pool holds {B}{B}{B}{B}{R}{G} (Black Lotus, Mox Jet, Mox Ruby, Gleemox chosen green) for X=3: {3}{2}{B}. X's part may be
# paid with black and/or red, so the pool pays it in two shapes - three black, or two black and the red - and which mana pays X
# is the payer's choice as they pay. Bot1 spends the red first, which pays X, then the black: the {B}, two more on X, one on
# the generic {2}, with the green. Soul Burn deals exactly 3 to the opponent (20 to 17), and Bot1 gains 2, the black spent on
# X, not the 3 damage dealt (20 to 22).
[Bot1 Deck]
Soul Burn
Black Lotus
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Gleemox
Swamp x2
Swamp x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x27

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Gleemox.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Gleemox.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Hand.Soul Burn.Cast(Bot2; X: 3; Spend: R, B, B, B, B, G)
Bot1.Pass
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Life = 22
Bot2.Life = 17
